{"game": "the-first-descendant", "language": "english", "appid": 2074920, "month": "2024-08", "window": 2, "start_date": 1723075200, "end_date": 1723766399, "month_true_total": 5081, "quota": 35, "returned": 35, "pulled_at": "2026-10-01 15:46:41 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "172211377", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058396472", "personaname": "ChadillacDad", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ChadillacDad/", "num_games_owned": 404, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 149, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 149, "last_played": 1723765858, "avatar": "21228275b3080fbd08eb7de40fa8ef7ad3098425"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is fun enough, but it's nothing new. After playing most destiny expansions, this is just more of the same. \nIf anything it's worse because all the guns sound and feel the same for the most part.\nI am so sick of having to go into my inventory to change to my best gear after every single encounter too. \nWhen will Devs realize that's only fun for about 3-5 times, then it just becomes tedious. \nGive me a \"Equip best gear\" button. \nBut you gotta select best weapon, then equip best mods, then go into your hero and do the same, equip best mods, and equip best chip to enhance abilities. It takes like 3 minutes or more after completing a mission that takes equally as long. \n\nThe Graphics are gorgeous and running it maxed out on my 4090 is just a sight to behold, but for now... I'm good. \\\n\nCheck it out, invest if you want but It's nothing groundbreaking.", "timestamp_created": 1723766299, "timestamp_updated": 1723766299, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172211115", "author": {"steamid": "76561197982570470", "personaname": "bpphantom", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bpphantom/", "num_games_owned": 849, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 22245, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 4, "playtime_at_review": 1123, "last_played": 1790858938, "avatar": "c6a2179d3d39a6a80286ba956c3668ca0ab80214"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a hot mess. Loads every once in awhile and takes way too long to actually start when it does load.\nThat said, the gunplay is good and the traversal is excellent. If they ever fix the CTD while compiling shaders (which it does Every. Damn. Time. for some reason) the it might even be worth spending money on in-game currency.\n\nOh, also it's got sexy women in bathing suits pewpewing the bad guys. I think they're the bad guys anyway.\n\nEDIT: Found a combination of fixes (not the ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ Ray Tracing one) that have seemed to resolve the shaders issue. Testing for a few days and then I'll update again if it works (and include the fixes).\n\nEDIT 2: Okay, both of the fixes I found from different sources seem to have resolved the Shader issue, so here they are.\nFrom Noirfragment on Reddit\n 1. Steam Settings -> Downloads -> Shader PRE-CACHING (Disable this and then re-enable it)\n2. Go to the following folder: C:\\Users\\YourName\\AppData\\Local\\NVIDIA and then delete the files that are INSIDE the GLCache folder. \n\nThen, from BuBaLoM on Steam:\nGo to C:\\Users\\blabla\\AppData\\Local\\M1\\Saved\\Config\\Windows\nopen Engine.ini , add\n\n[SystemSettings]\nr.ShaderPipelines=1\nr.ShaderPipelineCache.Enabled=0\nr.D3D.ForceDXC=1 \n\nBoth of those together have resolved the Preparing Shaders issue for me. I prepared them once after applying these and since then has just launched into the game without the expected CTD.", "timestamp_created": 1723765987, "timestamp_updated": 1724001658, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172210952", "author": {"steamid": "76561198112820901", "personaname": "angrymetaldude", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/angrymetaldude/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 63, "playtime_forever": 112, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 112, "last_played": 1720118105, "avatar": "db35e6e49df770faa5ff749ee91989fa06105ad7"}, "language": "english", "review": "the grappling hook seemed cool, but not enough to get me to play these types of games. also ♥♥♥♥ Nexon", "timestamp_created": 1723765742, "timestamp_updated": 1723765742, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172210383", "author": {"steamid": "76561198144256734", "personaname": "Luda", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198144256734/", "num_games_owned": 179, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 583, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 583, "last_played": 1720217100, "avatar": "d4fe7ecc9e9bae063e1d3f950cd7e7a33c3b2628"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just play Warframe or Destiny and come back when this is hopefully its own thing.", "timestamp_created": 1723765032, "timestamp_updated": 1723765032, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172210103", 