e"}, "language": "english", "review": "very good game", "timestamp_created": 1723759512, "timestamp_updated": 1723759512, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172205324", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003159839", "personaname": "Nya", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nekomimikamisama/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 399, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 399, "last_played": 1723566011, "avatar": "e56dd1da722af4e48971b168d97e7f2a50a48cdd"}, "language": "english", "review": "I thumb up for the equilibrium. It deserves the \"Mixed\". 6/10 (should be 7/10, but -1 because of NEXON)\n\n[strike]The First Descendant[/strike] Corpo Warframe (with boobs)\nI think this explains everything.\n\nCompares to Warframe, The First Descendant doesn't feel authentic.\nIn Warframe, there is more freedom in the early stage for you to grind certain warframe/weapons for builds and to be better.\nIn TDF, it feels like everything is linear. From story, to unlock descendant...\n\nThere is a similarity to Desitny, too, but Destiny has a better mission design.\n\nDoes it look cool? Yeah.\nDo I like the character design? Design-wise, it's okay, but and bob are great tho.\nDoes the gameplay design great? Umm... Boss fights are not the best, and some missions design is quite annoying.\nI will keep playing casually, but it is not on Warframe or Destiny's level.", "timestamp_created": 1723759467, "timestamp_updated": 1723759467, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "prim