d177bf5a30"}, "language": "english", "review": "pee pee poopoo", "timestamp_created": 1723744734, "timestamp_updated": 1723744734, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47445756196975708", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172189878", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983359695", "personaname": "GamezNChill_Youtube", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197983359695/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 8929, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7707, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1, "last_played": 1726328639, "avatar": "0a852df95dbd4ec25acc2e5f3fbfaf030f36ac92"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ok this game is really fun to play up until you unlock hard mode. Then it becomes Bot-like. I unlocked hard last month and for the past few weeks I have done nothing but try to farm a code that has a 6% droprate no matter where you farm it at. \r\n\r\nIf you just want to chill and play with friends for a few hours that one thing, but if you're trying to unlock characters without spending money, go to another game. The drop rates make this game not worth the time...\r\n\r\nSo my only dislike about this game is absolutely terrible drop rates...", "timestamp_created": 1723744724, "timestamp_updated": 1723744724, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.512055099010467529", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172189401", "author": {"steamid": "76561197975945236", "personaname": "Silorien", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/3van3elion/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6028, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3640, "last_played": 1756675927, "avatar": "42129b9860ae2b6b4f9b68e50d8cc0b0959f10e3"}, "language": "english", "review": "I never write Steam reviews, I usually can't be bothered to be honest. However I've been totally hooked to this game over the past week and I'm scratching my head about all the negative reviews. Yes, it's a Nexon game, the worst part about this game is the cash shop. Not because it has one, but because it's just too expensive. I'd happily support the game by buying a few skins if the pricing and currency packs weren't designed to make you spend as much as possible. That aside, It has gorgeous graphics and has run super smooth on my PC. The combat is fun and addictive. The missions are a little repetitive, something I hope they fix going forwards, but if the combat is fun then it's not a big issue. Yes, the drop rates for things are low, but this is literally a loot grinding game, I swear people just want everything handed to them. Since launch I've got Viessa (chosen starter), Bunny, Frenya and I'm just waiting for my Valby research to finish. At the end of the day, it takes time to level and properly build a character. Anyway, give the game a chance for yourself and don't listen too much to the moaners.", "timestamp_created": 1723744265, "timestamp_updated": 1723744265, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172188967", "author": {"steamid": "76561199162881194", "personaname": "duckharm", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199162881194/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1686, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1091, "last_played": 1725327142, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "destiny but on steroids way better and a better story and more cut scenes", "timestamp_created": 1723743841, "timestamp_updated": 1723743841, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172188011", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063314389", "personaname": "Syl", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Sylveria/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 54168, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 474, "playtime_at_review": 17491, "last_played": 1790788693, "avatar": "e07abb9f052f6a224a6569db3d2bb7639c0f2211"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h2] Why I don't recommend this erotic FPS gacha: [/h2]\n\n- The infinite / mindless grinding ruled by RNG. It's draining your sanity. You feel hollow once you've reached the end of one of the many goals you set yourself. You're basically just looking for items to craft characters/weapons with a very weak chance that RNG gives you the item, item you will have to go kill/grind a boss for a small chance to transform that item into 1 of the 4 parts needed to create the final character/weapon/item you want...\n\n- It's trying to sell you almost naked skins for the female characters. Should be cathegorised as an erotic game, with all the slùttish skins running around, or when standing idle, just prone with overly opened legs, so you can enjoy bikinis. Of course, only the females are sold as erotic meat while men just run in big badass armours. It is insulting for women. [i] (and not to mention all the sleazy pseudos...) [/i]\n\n- On top of that, the game is just a patchwork of existing games [i] (enemi minions behave and sound like Halo's / other enemis are just KOTOR's siths / one boss even just is Echo's basic skin from Overwatch 2 / landscapes are taken from those games as well, including Warframe / just to start with...) [/i]\n\n- Can't say the lore doesn't exist, but it is very poor. The NPCs tell you nonsenses to fill in the blanks, it's that bad to the point where you just cancel every dialogues/cinematics because it's uninteresting, uncreative and you just want to go back at your mindless grinding.\n\n- On top of all these, there's a battlepass system. So your hormones tell you to buy boobs and make you forget how hollow the game is.\n\nSo unless you don't want to own your appetite for se>< and run in an almost naked avatar to grind...\nNah, you will be more productive on a pornsite and then back at your appreciated usual games.\n\n[i] (I know, I have hours in the game atm, because it's one of the rare ones I can play with friends outside of DBD and Overwatch, since Apex has gone to $hit for a while now.) [/i]\n\nTake care of yourself with healthier games for your mental and happiness <3", "timestamp_created": 1723742863, "timestamp_updated": 1723744164, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.428427368402481079", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172186200", "author": {"steamid": "76561198105418068", "personaname": "Fidgetor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198105418068/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 28438, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4095, "last_played": 1766453605, "avatar": "face3cfb6e09fee225eeefc8cd5415903d86527b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game. Micros are not needed to play the game. You can easily finish the story without micros. Gameplay is good abilities are fun and gunplay feels responsive and clean. The bad would be I think the UI could use some streamlining a lot of menus and layers. Would like if I am searching for what items drops It would be nice to just show what percentage% it drops from so I dont need to spend 5 minutes searching through the variety of drop locations to find the one with the highest drop rate. ALSO GAME HAS CAKE", "timestamp_created": 1723741092, "timestamp_updated": 1723741092, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172185889", "author": {"steamid": "76561199096624552", "personaname": "AgonyzWrath", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199096624552/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 18883, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5747, "last_played": 1786636706, "avatar": "1eb2c7a82870e472502a22bb94508c999b9335e9"}, "language": "english", "review": "So far i'm loving the game", "timestamp_created": 1723740779, "timestamp_updated": 1723740779, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172185870", "author": {"steamid": "76561198335980917", "personaname": "antoniaaaa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198335980917/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 51, "play